  "caveat": "A plate-backed section CANNOT be generated from a content contract — it is a raster of a specific page. This contract exists so a validator can describe and check captured pages, NOT so a generator can author new ones. Known frozen widgets on 12 pages are listed at HANDOFF.md:284-290. Small UI text inside a mock-up is part of the plate and is not selectable. HANDOFF.md:292"
